Release: 2.1.3
  - Fix the sessionID login bug

Release: 2.1.2
  - Remove participant update. the insert already supports adding another version of a Participant

Release: 2.1.1
  - Fix bug where the connection between the connector and the participant was being overrided when adding a list of participants and removing a participant associated with a connector that has multiple participants
  - Fix bug where, when updating a participant with no refinement, it was returning null

Release: 2.1.0
  - Allow adding a version of a participant
  - Make the participant description a list

Release: 2.0.3
  - Allow the creation and association of Participants and Connectors
  - Update the Participant
  - Differentiate between Connector and Participant certificate

Release: 2.0.2
  - Replace BaseConnector with ParIS on configuration file (i.e., config.json)
  - Replace IDSA Maven project with INESCTEC Maven project

Release: 2.0.1
  - Add a Controller to add a Participant and a Connector at the same time (i.e., ParticipantFraunDto)
  - Add Endpoints to add and remove a Participant title
  - Add an Endpoint to retrieve a Connector using the ConnectorIDSEndpoint

Release: 2.0.0
  - Fix the encoding error that the accents generated. Now, characters like 'ç' can be used and will not be desconfigure
  - Fix the error when adding Participant, if the dates had UTC
  - Convert all LocalDateTime's into ZonedDateTime
  - Change Participant and Person to a ManyToMany relationship
  - Add methods to Associate a Connector and a Participant
  - On the ConnectorController add the necessary CRUD operations
  - Add Participant Removal

Release: 1.0.1
  - Add the Update endpoint for the Connectors
  - Add endpoint to, given a ConnectorID, list the Participant that it belongs to
  - Change data model to allow a Connector to belong to multiple Participants
  - Add method to remove a Participant on the Swagger UI

Release: 1.0.0
  - Update DataLoader to use real data
  - Add a DataLoader for the test classes
  - Add a Business Identifier Model to save the organisation (i.e., participant) activity sector

Release: 0.9.0
